14. Outcome
By combining artificial intelligence with a secure backend, FitTrack reduces the effort users spend on planning and tracking, and lets them concentrate on training consistently. JWT authentication, MongoDB data management and Gemini integration ensure that fitness resources are generated securely, efficiently and consistently. The modular architecture supports future enhancements with minimal changes.
15. Conclusion
FitTrack demonstrates how Generative AI can be integrated into a secure, scalable web backend to solve a real health and lifestyle problem. It centralizes fitness records and automates the creation of workout plans, diet plans and progress insights, thereby improving consistency, supporting personalized guidance and helping users reach their goals.
